{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅くなってごめなさい  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っはい、とりあえず名古屋長崎についてお話させてくださいまし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/31/4183892/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにもかくにも何よりも早く伝えたかった事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様、あんなにも暑い野外で、絶対熱中症になりかけた人とかいたと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなのにもかかわらずたっくさん盛り上げてくれたり、何時間も待っててくれたり、暖かく見守ってくださったり、本当に本当にありがとう(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に暑くて大変なはずなのにあみたちのやりやすい環境を作ってくれて、本当感謝よ(/ _ ; )。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはこれを伝えたかったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーそして、この2日間でわかったこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブって......楽しすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長年悩まされ続けていた私の代謝の悪さが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏に野外ライブという試みをはかったことによって、解決されたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは......本当に素晴らしい事です。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"額から滝汗（永島せいら）がでるなんて始めてで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛か汗でぐちゃぐちゃになっても夢中で踊り続けて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........はい幸せーー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高でございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそのぶん自分の中で新しい課題も見つかったし、またグループが団結出来た気がするんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからまた、次のライブの時にはもっとレベルアップしたあみたちが見れると思う！！(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度した失敗は絶対にしない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間からあみが心にとどめてる言葉よ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/31/4183892/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか今回みさみさとの写真多いな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーまた早くライブがやりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/31/4183892/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しは次回必ずやるねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃねっ"}],"source":"archive"}